  "notes": "Mediator state: hosts Al Udeid (largest US base in the region), a Turkish base, the Hamas political office and past US-Taliban talks. A September 2025 Israeli strike on Hamas officials in Doha led to a US executive order pledging to defend Qatar. In 2026 Iranian missile strikes hit Ras Laffan (cutting LNG capacity by about 17% for years) and Hamad International Airport; Qatar says it is not a party to the war and backs diplomacy. Game: neutral-mediator flavour, client for protection and hostage-handover security contracts. Small arms list follows the IISS-based inventory; exact standard-issue rifle is not well documented.",
